      "statement": "∀ {k G : Type _} [CommRing k] [Group G] (A B : Rep k G) (H : Subgroup G) (F : Quiver.Hom (Rep.res H.subtype B) (Rep.res H.subtype A)) (s t : G), (QuotientGroup.mk s : G ⧸ H) = QuotientGroup.mk t → ∀ x : B, A.ρ s (F.hom (B.ρ s⁻¹ x)) = A.ρ t (F.hom (B.ρ t⁻¹ x))",
